# Minsky per-machine bootstrap sidecar. `minsky-bootstrap` writes
# `.minsky/repo.yaml` with the canonical host-fork's GHE org name and
# ticket prefix so the autonomous run loop can pick & validate tasks
# from THIS host's TASKS.md. The content is intentionally fork-specific
# (e.g. "your-org/dotfiles", "PROJ-[0-9]+" on a private fork)
# and would point at a different host_repo / ticket_format on a public
# OSS fork. Keeping the file gitignored prevents identity leaks while
# letting each machine bootstrap its own loop.
.minsky/

# Stray agent artifacts created by misquoted shell commands.
# Misquoted `pip install pkg>=1.2.3` shells out to `pip install pkg`
# with stdout redirected to a file literally named `=1.2.3`. Quote
# pip specs (`pip install 'pkg>=1.2.3'`) and these will not appear.
=[0-9]*

# Secrets files — never track these
*.secrets
home/zshenv.secrets
home/bashenv.secrets
home/.profile.secrets

# Generated by agentbrew for project-local Devin hooks.
.devin/
